msgstr "Julius Lotar Mejer"

#: kalzium_i18n.cpp:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why is the group VIIIA called the Noble gases?"
msgstr "Zašto se grupa VIII-A zove plemeniti gasovi?"

#: kalzium_i18n.cpp:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Noble gases are unreactive and combine with other elements only with great "
"difficulty. Hence they are called noble because they do not mingle."
